<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Tarmac cut at Goldman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Tarmac cut at Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tarmac Plc was cut to &quot;market outperformer&quot; from the &quot;recommended list&quot; by Goldman Sachs, the investment bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>The stock was down 2-1/2p at 127-1/2, having risen strongly since the start of April to reach a 13-month high of 132p on May 16.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
